<title>USA: Prudential wins $60 mln Montgomery Cty, Pa., GOs.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins $60 mln Montgomery Cty, Pa., GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $60 million of Montgomery County, Pa., general obligation bonds with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.3975 percent.</p>
</text>
